# 0.2.1 FIX (Skyy: "after petting he looks funny" - the Hawk hung mid-air pecking): a petting animation must END by itself. An
# AnimationSets entry loops unless EVERY Animations[] item says "Looping": false (0.2 picked looping Eat / TiltHead / Curious / Alerted
# for 8 models). Only non-looping entries now; none -> no animation. Flying / fish looks get their own pick: an animation from a Fly/
# folder, or any of a model with no ground motion (its Fly set = its Walk set, e.g. Eye_Void); never Hurt / Death / Spawn / Despawn.
# Both tables cover EVERY vanilla model (a Server Setup look row may name any model); an unknown model = no animation. Each entry
# carries its play time in ms (blockyanim duration / 60 fps / Speed + 0.5 s, 2 - 6 s): the Action slot is cleared after it.
